  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi Electoral Support Project (MESP) 2022 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focusses on building the capacities of the main stakeholders responsible for the organization of the elections and for establishing the most propitious environment possible for the elections. It seeks to encourage inclusive approaches so as to favour elections that genuinely represent the will of the voters as well as to put in place measures to reduce the risk of political violence. In addition, the project promotes constructive debates and discussions around issues of national concern while also considering the potential negative role of social media in the spread of misinformation, disinformation and hate speech.</narrative>
  </description>
